---
import { getImage } from 'astro:assets'
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import heroSrc from './images/hero.png'

const title = '死揸科技股，跟到嘅都飛天 | 由 500萬 滾到近 2,000萬'
const description = '一日賺五、六萬，你就明咩叫含金量。長期複利嘅威力——有客由 500萬 滾到近 2,000萬。專注一線 research，拆解機構交易嘅底層 logic，散戶早人一步捉到下一個科技板塊機會。'

const heroImg = await getImage({ src: heroSrc, format: 'webp', width: 880, quality: 76 })
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} lang="zh-HK">
  <link slot="head" rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link slot="head" rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link
    slot="head"
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anton&family=Noto+Sans+HK:wght@400;500;700;900&display=swap"
    rel="stylesheet"
  />

  <!-- ═══════════ 背景層（純黑 + 紅色徑向 glow，無粒子）═══════════ -->
  <div class="bg-glow" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="glow g1"></span>
    <span class="glow g2"></span>
  </div>

  <div class="page">
    <!-- ═══════════ 屏 1 · 海報大字 · 巨號戰績 HERO ═══════════ -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-bg" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src={heroImg.src} alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
        <span class="hero-scrim"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-body">
        <h1 class="kicker reveal">
          死揸科技股<br /><span class="kicker-em">跟到嘅都飛天</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="proof reveal">
          由 <span class="pf-from">500萬</span>本金，滾到近 <span class="pf-to"><b id="statTo">2,000</b>萬</span>
        </p>

        <p class="lede reveal">一日賺<b>五、六萬</b>，你先至明咩叫「含金量」。</p>

        <a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="mixinJump()" class="wa-cta reveal" data-evt="hero">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12.04 2C6.58 2 2.13 6.45 2.13 11.91c0 1.75.46 3.46 1.32 4.96L2 22l5.25-1.38a9.9 9.9 0 0 0 4.79 1.22h.01c5.46 0 9.91-4.45 9.91-9.91 0-2.65-1.03-5.14-2.9-7.01A9.82 9.82 0 0 0 12.04 2Zm5.8 14.16c-.25.69-1.43 1.32-1.97 1.4-.5.08-1.14.11-1.84-.12-.42-.13-.97-.31-1.66-.61-2.93-1.27-4.84-4.22-4.99-4.41-.15-.2-1.19-1.58-1.19-3.01 0-1.43.75-2.13 1.02-2.42.27-.29.58-.36.78-.36.2 0 .39 0 .56.01.18.01.42-.07.66.5.25.59.83 2.02.9 2.17.07.15.12.32.02.51-.09.2-.14.32-.27.49-.14.17-.29.38-.41.51-.14.14-.28.29-.12.57.16.27.71 1.17 1.52 1.9 1.05.93 1.93 1.22 2.21 1.36.27.14.43.12.59-.07.16-.2.68-.79.86-1.07.18-.27.36-.22.61-.13.25.09 1.6.75 1.87.89.27.14.45.2.52.32.07.12.07.69-.18 1.38Z"></path></svg>
          即刻跟住我哋一齊玩 · 加 WhatsApp
        </a>
        <p class="cta-sub reveal">搵助理即時回覆 · 睇下今期點部署科技板塊</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══════════ 全寬大字宣言帶 ═══════════ -->
    <section class="manifesto reveal">
      <p class="mf-line">講緊嘅，係<br /><span class="mf-em">長期複利嘅真實威力</span></p>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══════════ 價值 · 極短兩點（大字 + SVG）═══════════ -->
    <section class="claims">
      <div class="claim reveal">
        <svg class="cl-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"><rect x="4" y="11" width="16" height="9" rx="2"></rect><path d="M8 11V8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0"></path><path d="M12 15v2"></path></svg>
        <h2 class="cl-h">破解機構交易密碼</h2>
        <p class="cl-p">專注一線 research，拆解機構 trade 嘅底層 logic，等散戶唔使再輸蝕喺消息慢人一步，早人一步上到下一個行情。</p>
      </div>
      <span class="claims-div" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <div class="claim reveal">
        <svg class="cl-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"><path d="M9 18h6"></path><path d="M10 21h4"></path><path d="M12 3a6 6 0 0 0-4 10.5c.6.6 1 1.3 1 2.2h6c0-.9.4-1.6 1-2.2A6 6 0 0 0 12 3Z"></path></svg>
        <h2 class="cl-h">最懂散戶嘅實戰專家</h2>
        <p class="cl-p">冇咁多花臣 theory，淨係每日實戰 re-cap，梳理行情主線、拆解升跌 logic。無論你係初哥，定係輸開錢嘅老散，都建立到屬於自己嘅 Trading System。</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══════════ 評價 · 橫向緊湊一行 ═══════════ -->
    <section class="voices reveal">
      <div class="voice">
        <div class="v-stars" aria-label="五星好評">★★★★★</div>
        <p>「跟咗大半年，由蝕住入嚟到而家識睇主線。死揸幾隻科技股，真係一路 take off，呢半年賺返嘅，係之前自己亂炒蝕嘅幾倍。」</p>
        <div class="v-by"><span class="v-av">陳</span><b>陳生</b><i>跟咗 8 個月</i></div>
      </div>
      <div class="voice">
        <div class="v-stars" aria-label="五星好評">★★★★★</div>
        <p>「最啱我呢啲打工仔，唔使自己成日睇市。每日 re-cap 梳理得好清楚，邊隻點部署、幾時走，講到明明白白，跟住做就得。」</p>
        <div class="v-by"><span class="v-av">L</span><b>Leo</b><i>跟咗 4 個月</i></div>
      </div>
      <div class="voice">
        <div class="v-stars" aria-label="五星好評">★★★★★</div>
        <p>「之前喺街邊跟人嗌單蝕到怕，呢度唔同——係教你睇背後個 logic。慢慢建立到自己一套，依家落手落腳都有譜。」</p>
        <div class="v-by"><span class="v-av">黃</span><b>黃小姐</b><i>跟咗 6 個月</i></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══════════ 巨大最終 CTA ═══════════ -->
    <section class="finale reveal">
      <div class="fn-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <h2 class="fn-h">想跟住我哋<br />一齊玩？</h2>
      <p class="fn-p">搵助理即時回覆，睇下今期點部署科技板塊嘅下一站。</p>
      <a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="mixinJump()" class="wa-cta" data-evt="final">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12.04 2C6.58 2 2.13 6.45 2.13 11.91c0 1.75.46 3.46 1.32 4.96L2 22l5.25-1.38a9.9 9.9 0 0 0 4.79 1.22h.01c5.46 0 9.91-4.45 9.91-9.91 0-2.65-1.03-5.14-2.9-7.01A9.82 9.82 0 0 0 12.04 2Zm5.8 14.16c-.25.69-1.43 1.32-1.97 1.4-.5.08-1.14.11-1.84-.12-.42-.13-.97-.31-1.66-.61-2.93-1.27-4.84-4.22-4.99-4.41-.15-.2-1.19-1.58-1.19-3.01 0-1.43.75-2.13 1.02-2.42.27-.29.58-.36.78-.36.2 0 .39 0 .56.01.18.01.42-.07.66.5.25.59.83 2.02.9 2.17.07.15.12.32.02.51-.09.2-.14.32-.27.49-.14.17-.29.38-.41.51-.14.14-.28.29-.12.57.16.27.71 1.17 1.52 1.9 1.05.93 1.93 1.22 2.21 1.36.27.14.43.12.59-.07.16-.2.68-.79.86-1.07.18-.27.36-.22.61-.13.25.09 1.6.75 1.87.89.27.14.45.2.52.32.07.12.07.69-.18 1.38Z"></path></svg>
        加 WhatsApp · 搵助理即時回覆
      </a>    </section>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══════════ 底部 STICKY CTA ═══════════ -->
  <div class="sticky-cta" id="stickyCta">
    <div class="sc-txt"><b>今期科技板塊點部署</b><span>搵助理即時回覆</span></div>
    <a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="mixinJump()" class="sc-btn" data-evt="sticky">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12.04 2C6.58 2 2.13 6.45 2.13 11.91c0 1.75.46 3.46 1.32 4.96L2 22l5.25-1.38a9.9 9.9 0 0 0 4.79 1.22h.01c5.46 0 9.91-4.45 9.91-9.91 0-2.65-1.03-5.14-2.9-7.01A9.82 9.82 0 0 0 12.04 2Zm5.8 14.16c-.25.69-1.43 1.32-1.97 1.4-.5.08-1.14.11-1.84-.12-.42-.13-.97-.31-1.66-.61-2.93-1.27-4.84-4.22-4.99-4.41-.15-.2-1.19-1.58-1.19-3.01 0-1.43.75-2.13 1.02-2.42.27-.29.58-.36.78-.36.2 0 .39 0 .56.01.18.01.42-.07.66.5.25.59.83 2.02.9 2.17.07.15.12.32.02.51-.09.2-.14.32-.27.49-.14.17-.29.38-.41.51-.14.14-.28.29-.12.57.16.27.71 1.17 1.52 1.9 1.05.93 1.93 1.22 2.21 1.36.27.14.43.12.59-.07.16-.2.68-.79.86-1.07.18-.27.36-.22.61-.13.25.09 1.6.75 1.87.89.27.14.45.2.52.32.07.12.07.69-.18 1.38Z"></path></svg>
      加入
    </a>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══════════ JS ═══════════ -->
  <script is:inline>
// ── 滾動入場 ──
function initReveal() {
  const els = Array.prototype.slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.reveal'))
  function check() {
    const h = window.innerHeight
    for (let i = els.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
      if (els[i].getBoundingClientRect().top < h * 0.9) {
        els[i].classList.add('in')
        els.splice(i, 1)
      }
    }
  }
  check()
  window.addEventListener('scroll', check, { passive: true })
  window.addEventListener('resize', check, { passive: true })
}

// ── 巨號戰績 countup（500 → 近 2,000 萬）+ 飆升線 draw-on ──
function runStats() {
  const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches
  const toEl = document.getElementById('statTo')
  const path = document.getElementById('surgePath')
  if (!toEl)
    return

  if (path && !reduce) {
    const len = path.getTotalLength()
    path.style.strokeDasharray = String(len)
    path.style.strokeDashoffset = String(len)
    requestAnimationFrame(() => {
      path.style.transition = 'stroke-dashoffset 1.8s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)'
      path.style.strokeDashoffset = '0'
    })
  }

  if (reduce) {
    toEl.textContent = '2,000'
    return
  }

  const target = 2000
  const start = 500
  const dur = 1800
  const t0 = performance.now()
  function tick(now) {
    const p = Math.min(1, (now - t0) / dur)
    const eased = 1 - (1 - p) ** 3
    const val = Math.round(start + (target - start) * eased)
    toEl.textContent = val.toLocaleString('en-US')
    if (p < 1)
      requestAnimationFrame(tick)
  }
  requestAnimationFrame(tick)
}

// ── 底部 sticky CTA：滾動超過 hero 先顯示 ──
function initSticky() {
  const sc = document.getElementById('stickyCta')
  const hero = document.querySelector('.hero')
  if (!sc || !hero)
    return
  function check() {
    sc.classList.toggle('show', window.scrollY > hero.offsetHeight - 120)
  }
  check()
  window.addEventListener('scroll', check, { passive: true })
}

document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
  initReveal()
  runStats()
  initSticky()
})
</script>

  <!-- ═══════════ CSS ═══════════ -->
  <style is:global>
    :root {
      --bg: #0c0c0e;
      --bg2: #161619;
      --red: #ff2d3f;
      --red2: #ff5a4d;
      --orange: #ff6a3d;
      --gold: #ffb020;
      --wa: #25d366;
      --wa2: #1fb457;
      --tx: #f7f7fa;
      --tx2: #c2c2cb;
      --tx3: #76767f;
      --line: rgba(255, 45, 63, .18);
    }

    html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--tx);
      font-family: 'Noto Sans HK', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    /* ── 背景：純黑 + 紅色徑向 glow ── */
    .bg-glow { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none; overflow: hidden; }
    .glow { position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; filter: blur(80px); }
    .glow.g1 { top: -18%; left: -16%; width: 78vw; height: 78vw; max-width: 540px; max-height: 540px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 45, 63, .22), transparent 66%); }
    .glow.g2 { bottom: -8%; right: -18%; width: 70vw; height: 70vw; max-width: 480px; max-height: 480px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 106, 61, .16), transparent 66%); }

    .page { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

    /* ── reveal ── */
    .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(26px); transition: opacity .7s ease, transform .7s cubic-bezier(.2, .7, .2, 1); }
    .reveal.in { opacity: 1; transform: none; }

    /* ── 共用 CTA ── */
    .wa-cta { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 18px; border-radius: 15px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--wa), var(--wa2)); color: #fff; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.04rem; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(37, 211, 102, .34); animation: waPulse 2.6s ease-in-out infinite; }
    .wa-cta svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .wa-cta:hover { box-shadow: 0 16px 42px rgba(37, 211, 102, .5); }
    .cta-sub { font-size: .74rem; color: var(--tx3); margin: 12px 0 0; text-align: center; }

    /* ── HERO（全屏圖主導 · 電影海報）── */
    .hero { position: relative; min-height: 100svh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-end; padding: 0 24px calc(40px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden; }
    .hero-bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: -2; }
    .hero-bg img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 38%; }
    .hero-scrim { position: absolute; inset: 0; background:
      radial-gradient(130% 68% at 50% 14%, transparent 0%, transparent 34%, rgba(8, 8, 10, .5) 100%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(8, 8, 10, .58) 0%, rgba(8, 8, 10, .06) 24%, rgba(8, 8, 10, .32) 56%, rgba(12, 12, 14, .97) 100%); }
    .hero-body { position: relative; z-index: 1; width: 100%; max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: left; }

    /* 鉤子大字 */
    .kicker { font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 12.5vw, 3.7rem); font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -.02em; margin: 0 0 18px; color: #fff; text-shadow: 0 2px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, .6); }
    .kicker-em { background: linear-gradient(100deg, var(--orange), var(--red2) 45%, var(--red)); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 26px rgba(255, 45, 63, .5)); }

    /* 戰績證明（緊湊一行）*/
    .proof { margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 1.04rem; color: var(--tx2); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.35; }
    .pf-from { color: var(--tx); font-weight: 800; }
    .pf-to { color: var(--red2); white-space: nowrap; }
    .pf-to b { font-family: 'Anton', 'Noto Sans HK', sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: .01em; color: var(--red2); text-shadow: 0 0 26px rgba(255, 45, 63, .55); }

    .lede { font-size: clamp(.96rem, 4vw, 1.08rem); color: var(--tx2); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 26px; font-weight: 500; max-width: 32ch; }
    .lede b { color: var(--red2); font-weight: 900; }
    .hero .wa-cta { font-size: .96rem; }
    .hero .cta-sub { text-align: left; }

    /* ── 全寬大字宣言帶（強紅色塊）── */
    .manifesto { position: relative; padding: 56px 24px; text-align: center; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--red), #d61f30 60%, #b81525); overflow: hidden; }
    .manifesto::before { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(255, 106, 61, .5), transparent 55%); }
    .mf-line { position: relative; font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 8vw, 2.8rem); font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.18; letter-spacing: -.01em; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .82); margin: 0; }
    .mf-em { color: #fff; text-shadow: 0 2px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, .35); }

    /* ── 價值 · 極短兩點（大字 + SVG，無卡片）── */
    .claims { max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 64px 24px; }
    .claim { text-align: center; }
    .cl-ico { width: 40px; height: 40px; color: var(--red2); margin: 0 auto 16px; display: block; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(255, 45, 63, .4)); }
    .cl-h { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 6.6vw, 2rem); font-weight: 900; color: #fff; margin: 0 0 12px; letter-spacing: -.01em; line-height: 1.2; }
    .cl-p { font-size: .92rem; color: var(--tx2); line-height: 1.75; margin: 0; }
    .claims-div { display: block; width: 56px; height: 3px; margin: 40px auto; border-radius: 2px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--red), transparent); }

    /* ── 評價 · 橫向緊湊一行（橫掃）── */
    .voices { display: flex; gap: 14px; overflow-x: auto; padding: 8px 24px 64px; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; scroll-snap-type: x mandatory; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; scrollbar-width: none; }
    .voices::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
    .voice { flex: 0 0 80%; max-width: 300px; scroll-snap-align: center; padding: 20px; border-radius: 16px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .07); box-sizing: border-box; }
    .v-stars { color: var(--gold); font-size: .82rem; letter-spacing: .14em; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .voice p { font-size: .85rem; color: var(--tx); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 14px; }
    .v-by { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; }
    .v-av { width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255, 45, 63, .14); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 45, 63, .3); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--red2); font-weight: 700; font-size: .78rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .v-by b { font-size: .8rem; color: #fff; }
    .v-by i { font-size: .68rem; color: var(--tx3); font-style: normal; margin-left: auto; }

    /* ── 巨大最終 CTA ── */
    .finale { position: relative; overflow: hidden; max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 60px 24px 90px; text-align: center; }
    .fn-glow { position: absolute; top: -10%; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); width: 130%; height: 100%; background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 20%, rgba(255, 45, 63, .28), transparent 60%); pointer-events: none; }
    .finale > * { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .fn-h { font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 9.5vw, 3rem); font-weight: 900; color: #fff; margin: 0 0 14px; line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
    .fn-p { font-size: .96rem; color: var(--tx2); margin: 0 0 26px; line-height: 1.6; }
    .risk { font-size: .68rem; color: var(--tx3); margin: 16px 0 0; line-height: 1.65; }

    /* ── sticky CTA ── */
    .sticky-cta { position: fixed; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; z-index: 200; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 11px 16px calc(11px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); background: rgba(12, 12, 14, .92); backdrop-filter: blur(14px); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); transform: translateY(110%); transition: transform .35s cubic-bezier(.2, .7, .2, 1); }
    .sticky-cta.show { transform: none; }
    .sc-txt { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
    .sc-txt b { display: block; font-size: .84rem; color: #fff; }
    .sc-txt span { font-size: .68rem; color: var(--tx3); }
    .sc-btn { flex-shrink: 0; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 12px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--wa), var(--wa2)); color: #fff; font-weight: 800; font-size: .9rem; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(37, 211, 102, .35); }
    .sc-btn svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; }

    /* ── keyframes ── */
    @keyframes waPulse { 0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); } 50% { transform: scale(1.015); } }

    /* ── 桌面增強 ── */
